<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Dune</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600&family=Nunito:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body style="--a:#f5a524;--b:#ffd36b"><div class="wrap"><article class="card"><div class="top"><div class="emoji">🏜️</div><h1>Dune</h1><span class="genre">Science fiction</span></div><div class="body"><h2>About this book</h2><p>On the desert planet Arrakis, the only source of a priceless spice, young Paul Atreides is thrown into a struggle between noble houses, giant sandworms and the people of the desert. A large-scale epic about politics, ecology, religion and destiny.</p></div></article></div></body></html>